  "prefLabel": "En 807.05 Response to Notice of Violation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 807.05 Response to Notice of Violation. Within 10 days from receipt of the NOV, the respondent shall either:\n\n(a) Sign a consent agreement and remit the civil penalty; or\n\n(b) File a request in writing for a hearing before the department.\n\nSource. #14062, eff 8-21-24",
